  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Optimized Decision Making with Azure OpenAI",
    "splashDescription": "Operationalize AI with Azure OpenAI and Camunda. Azure OpenAI is a suite of AI services provided by Microsoft that offers advanced language models (including GPT-3, 4 and others) to understand and generate human-like text. This blueprint leverages the power of Azure OpenAI to bring advanced natural language understanding, contextual awareness, and predictive analytics to business processes that are orchestrated by Camunda. Use Camunda with Azure OpenAI to streamline and enhance decision-making in your most critical business processes.",
